              <heading>Section 4 (at the end of the definition of designated cancer)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Add:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <content>
                  <p>; (c)	lung cancer.</p>
                </content>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2">
              <num>2</num>
              <heading>At the end of section 10</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Add:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2__qstr-1__subsec-3">
                  <num>3</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>The register may include information relating to individuals in connection with screening associated with lung cancer.</p>
                  </content>
                  <content>
                    <p>[<i>Minister’s second reading speech made in—</i></p>
